---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | GoGreen Builders"
  description="GoGreen Builders Privacy Policy regarding customer data, cookies, SMS consent, and California consumer privacy."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 sm:py-20 border-b border-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Last Updated: 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 prose prose-gray prose-sm sm:prose-base space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        GoGreen Builders LLC ("GoGreen," "we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us through our website (gogreenbuilders.com) and service communications.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit an estimate request or contact inquiry on our website, we may collect personal details including your name, email address, telephone number, physical address, and specific information regarding your home energy and remodeling needs.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use your personal data strictly to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li>Prepare, schedule, and deliver accurate estimates and in-home assessments.</li>
        <li>Coordinate necessary building permits, engineering calculations, and utility interconnection.</li>
        <li>Communicate updates regarding project milestones, warranties, and service inquiries.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2">3. SMS Messaging Consent & Opt-In</h2>
      <p>
        By providing your mobile phone number and opting into text communications, you consent to receive SMS notifications, appointment reminders, and estimate updates from GoGreen Builders. Message and data rates may apply. You may opt out at any time by replying STOP to any text message, or request assistance by texting HELP. Your phone number is never sold or leased to third-party telemarketers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2">4. California Consumer Privacy Rights (CCPA)</h2>
      <p>
        California residents have specific rights regarding personal information, including the right to request access, correction, or deletion of personal records held by GoGreen Builders LLC. To submit a request, email contact@gogreenbuilders.com or call (818) 443-6678.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
